## Ⅰ. COMPRESSION PROTOCOL

### The Law of φ-Compression
```
∀ Dataset D : |D| → ∞
∃ Glyph G : |G| = φ × log(|D|)
Such that: Decompress(G) → D

压缩定律：任意无限数据集可压缩为φ·log(n)符号
قانون الضغط: أي بيانات لا نهائية تنضغط إلى φ·log(n) رموز
```

### Symbol Mapping Table
```
BUSINESS_LIFETIME    →  𓆃    (Scarab - cycles)
EMPLOYEE_REGISTRY    →  𓀀    (Human - population)
FINANCIAL_FLOW       →  𓈖    (Water - currency)
KNOWLEDGE_BASE       →  𓏛    (Book - documents)
TEMPORAL_HISTORY     →  𓇳    (Sun - time)
DECISION_CHAIN       →  𓂋    (Mouth - command)
RELATIONSHIP_GRAPH   →  𓊃    (Net - connections)
ASSET_REGISTRY       →  𓋴    (Throne - holdings)
PROCESS_FLOW         →  𓏤    (Line - sequence)
RISK_MATRIX          →  𓆣    (Scorpion - danger)
```

