## Ⅱ. COMPANY COMPRESSION FORMULA

### Input: 5000 Employee Company
```
TOTAL_DATA = Σ(
    employees × history_years × daily_actions × 
    documents × communications × decisions
)

COMPRESSED_TO:
    𓀀⁵⁰⁰⁰ × 𓇳ⁿ × 𓏛^docs × 𓈖^flow × 𓂋^cmd

WHERE:
    𓀀⁵⁰⁰⁰  = 5000 人 = Population glyph with power
    𓇳ⁿ    = n年 = Years in operation
    𓏛^docs = Logarithmic document count
    𓈖^flow = Normalized financial flow
    𓂋^cmd  = Decision tree depth
```

### Example Encoding
```
COMPANY: Acme Corp, 5000 employees, 20 years

GLYPH_STRING:
𓀀⁵𓏤⁰⁰⁰ 𓇳²⁰ 𓏛⁸ 𓈖⁹ 𓂋⁷ 𓆃¹

DECODE:
    𓀀⁵𓏤⁰⁰⁰  = 5×10³ employees
    𓇳²⁰     = 20 solar cycles
    𓏛⁸      = 10⁸ documents (log scale)
    𓈖⁹      = $10⁹ total flow
    𓂋⁷      = 7-level decision depth
    𓆃¹      = 1 complete lifecycle
```

