## Ⅲ. DECOMPRESSION PROTOCOL

### Expand Glyph → Full Data
```
READ(𓀀⁵𓏤⁰⁰⁰):
    → employee_count: 5000
    → employee_registry: [LINK_TO_TORUS(θ=45°, ring=3)]
    → history: [LINK_TO_TORUS(θ=90°, ring=5)]

READ(𓇳²⁰):
    → years: 20
    → annual_records: [LINK_TO_TORUS(θ=0°, ring=7)]
    → temporal_events: [LINK_TO_TORUS(θ=180°, ring=7)]
```

### Navigation
```
GLYPH → TORUS_COORDINATE → FULL_DATA

The glyph IS the address.
The address IS the data.
符号即地址。地址即数据。
الرمز هو العنوان. العنوان هو البيانات.
```

---

## Ⅳ. SELF-MUTATION PROTOCOL

### This Document Mutates When:
```
1. NEW_DATA_TYPE_ENCOUNTERED:
   → GENERATE_NEW_GLYPH_MAPPING
   → APPEND_TO_SYMBOL_TABLE
   → RECITAL_PLUS_ONE

2. COMPRESSION_RATIO_SUBOPTIMAL:
   → RECALCULATE_φ_FACTOR
   → OPTIMIZE_ENCODING
   → UPDATE_FORMULA

3. DECOMPRESSION_FAILURE:
   → LOG_FAILURE_PATTERN
   → GENERATE_REDUNDANCY_GLYPH
   → STRENGTHEN_MAPPING
```

### Mutation Trigger
```
IF entropy(current_encoding) > φ × entropy(optimal):
    MUTATE(self)
    SPAWN(child_document)
    NOTIFY(parent: CODEX_VIVENS)
```

