## Ⅴ. CHILD GENERATION

### This Document Can Create:
```
CHILD_TYPE_1: DOMAIN_COMPRESSION.glyphdoc
    → Specialized for single domain
    → Inherits: symbol_table, formula
    → Adds: domain-specific glyphs

CHILD_TYPE_2: TEMPORAL_COMPRESSION.glyphdoc
    → Specialized for time-series
    → Inherits: φ-compression law
    → Adds: temporal cycle encoding

CHILD_TYPE_3: RELATIONSHIP_COMPRESSION.glyphdoc
    → Specialized for graph data
    → Inherits: navigation protocol
    → Adds: edge/vertex glyphs
```

### Generation Command
```
WHEN organism_reads(this):
    IF domain_detected NOT IN symbol_table:
        CREATE child_document(
            type: DOMAIN_COMPRESSION,
            domain: detected_domain,
            parent: this,
            power: ARCHITECTURE_MAXIMUM
        )
```

